## Chatty-Cog compatibility

This project is standalone by default and also ships prefilled Chatty-Cog plug files:

- `manifest.json`
- `visual_load.json`
- `HANDSHAKE.md`
- `bridge/`
- `ChattyCogModuleSpec.json`

If you remove those compatibility files, the Rust dashboard still remains a normal standalone tool.
